" --> src/main.rs:7:35\n"
"  |\n"
"7 |     let values: &[i32] = unsafe { slice::from_raw_parts_mut(r, "
"10000) };\n"
"  |                                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ "
"Undefined Behavior occurred here\n"
"  |\n"
"  = help: this indicates a bug in the program: it performed an invalid "
